  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Towards Global Declaration of Rinderpest Eradication in 2011 and Strategies for a Post-Rinderpest World</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the actions proposed is to bring to a conclusion the progress made to date in eradicating rinderpest disease and thus guaranteeing the improved incomes and livelihoods that accrue to ruminant livestock raisers now that rinderpest no longer periodically devastates their herds.  br Specifically, the several remaining countries will obtain official rinderpest-free status thus the world will achieve Global Rinderpest Eradication by 2011.</narrative>
  </description>
